ClaimStatusRoutingV82.lean — kernel module for the v87 risk-analysis artifact
==============================================================================

Scope statement (one paragraph)
--------------------------------
This module proves consequences of its own definitions in Lean 4's logic. A
kernel-checked theorem here is a fact about the stated formal model only — it
does not establish empirical risk truth, causal mechanisms, policy efficacy,
reviewer behavior, governance feasibility, or real-world adequacy of any
classification. Treat every theorem name as a claim about the model, never as
an empirical or policy conclusion.

Build
-----
This is a pure Lean 4 module: no `import`, no Mathlib.

    rm -rf .lake
    lake build

Toolchain is pinned in `../lean-toolchain` (leanprover/lean4:v4.21.0).

